.SH NAME
inspekt\-focused \- Get information about the currently focused element.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]focused\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]]
\f[I]SUBCOMMAND\f[R] [\f[I]ARGS\f[R]]\&...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Get information about the currently focused element.
.PP
Shows details about the element that currently has keyboard/input focus
(document.activeElement).
Useful for testing focus management, keyboard navigation, and form
interactions.
.PP
To focus an element: 1.
Press Tab key to navigate between focusable elements 2.
Click an input field, button, link, or other interactive element 3.
Run: inspekt focused
.PP
Or use keyboard shortcuts: Alt+Tab, Cmd+Tab: Switch focus between
windows Tab/Shift+Tab: Navigate between focusable elements
.PP
Subcommands: inspekt focused html Get element as HTML inspekt focused
markdown Get element as Markdown inspekt focused text Get element text
content inspekt focused css Get computed CSS styles as nested CSS
